# Routing & cache safety

## Business profile routing

- Canonical business profile route: `/profile/v2`
- Do not reintroduce `/listing/[id]` or `/profile/[id]` as primary entry points
- Map, Explore, Favorites, and My Businesses must navigate to `/profile/v2`

## Discover / map cache

- Deleted or tombstoned businesses must not appear on Map, Explore, Favorites, or My Businesses
- Use `lib/businessListingVisibility.ts` and `lib/deletedBusinessRegistry.ts` for filtering
- On 404 or purge: call `purgeBusinessFromClientCaches()` and refresh discover listings
- Do not bypass `filterDisplayableDiscoverableListings()` when merging discover data

## Before changing routes or cache logic

1. List all entry points affected (grep for old paths).
2. Verify delete → marker removal and no stale profile flash.
3. Run regression items: Map Markers, Business Profile, Favorites, Data Refresh, Routing, Navigation.
